message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Pallier"
    given-names: "Christophe"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3324-666X"
title: "Pinel localizer: a gostim2 implementation of the Pinel functional localizer"
abstract: >-
  An implementation, for the gostim2 stimulus delivery system, of the
  Pinel functional localizer -- a short fMRI protocol probing language,
  arithmetic, motor and visual networks in a single run. Stimulus sets
  are provided in French, English and Spanish. The program code is
  licensed under Apache-2.0; the stimulus material, designed by Philippe
  Pinel at INSERM U562, is licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0.
version: latest
